==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|treat with kid gloves}}

===Etymology===
[[Image:Self-lacing kid gloves.gif|thumb|right]]
From {{m|en|kid glove}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|en-au-handle with kid gloves.ogg|Audio (AU)}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|*|head=[[handle]] [[with]] [[kid glove]]s}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} To treat something very [[delicately]] or [[carefully]].
#: ''The campaign staff cautioned the candidate to '''handle''' the issue '''with kid gloves'''.''

